===Etymology===
From a {{der|fi|gem}} language, possibly from {{der|fi|gem-pro|*felhaną||to hide, conceal}}, but the semantic development seems unusual. Cognates include {{cog|izh|pelastaa}} and {{cog|krl|pelastoa}}.

